Installation Instructions for crau-nbd
======================================

Prerequisites
-------------
To build and run crau-nbd, you need:
- A C++20 compliant compiler (g++ 13+ or clang++ 16+)
- CMake 3.20+
- GNU Make or Ninja
- Protobuf compiler (protoc) and C++ development libraries
- liblzma development headers (xz)
- libbz2 development headers (bzip2)
- Linux kernel with NBD support (modprobe nbd)
- polkit (for pkexec privilege elevation)

Building from Source
--------------------
To configure and compile crau-nbd:

  $ cmake -B build -S . -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr/local
  $ cmake --build build -j$(nproc)

Running Tests
-------------
To execute the automated test suite:

  $ ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure

Installation
------------
To install the binary and manual page into the designated prefix:

  $ sudo make -C build install
